      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Set the FLUX Fill loaders, background prompt and style_prompt before running. First editor: masks, completion regions, depth order. Second editor: arrange cached reconstructed layers. Change masks in the FIRST editor to regenerate hidden content. Then open the second editor again. Each editor pauses on new source data."
